==English==

===Etymology===
Initial of {{w|Kellogg Company}}. The drug was nicknamed humorously after the cereal, since it begins with the letter ''k''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|En-au-Special K.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[special|Special]] [[K]]}}

# A [[breakfast]] [[cereal]] made primarily from [[rice]] and [[wheat]].
#* '''1980''', Stephen King, ''The Mist''
#*: He seemed better this morning; he had eaten two donuts and a bowl of '''Special K''' for breakfast.

